00:11:57.910 --> 00:11:58.750
crazy

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:01.730
the life that we live really is.

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:04.283
You know, neither of us grew up this way.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.373
We've never known anything like this.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:09.990
And so,

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:12.210
we start to normalize

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:13.930
the things that happened down here and,

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:15.310
and the lives we live.

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:16.143
But,

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:19.460
when I went to jail
and my mind cleared up,

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:22.050
it kind of dawned on me how

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:27.060
crazy and how pathetic, you know,

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:28.560
things really are.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.100
