00:12:34.889 --> 00:12:36.100
Every day almost.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.690
Yeah.

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:38.523
- Yeah, we have,

00:12:38.523 --> 00:12:41.503
we have conversations almost
every single day about,

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:45.103
wanting,

00:12:45.103 --> 00:12:46.180
wanting to get out of here,

00:12:46.180 --> 00:12:47.930
and try and get out of here.

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:49.360
- You just get stuck, you know?

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:50.446
Yeah

00:12:50.446 --> 00:12:51.279
- Yeah.

00:12:51.279 --> 00:12:52.112
- [Mark] Yeah.

00:12:52.112 --> 00:12:52.945
- Yeah. It's,

00:12:52.945 --> 00:12:55.160
when we probably, within our first week

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:57.310
