00:12:57.310 --> 00:13:00.110
This old man was crossing, older guy,

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:02.850
he was probably in his fifties,
was crossing the street,

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:05.900
and he said something to us and he said,

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:07.650
don't get stuck down here.

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:08.860
You know, that happened to me.

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:11.280
I've been down here for 27 years.

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:14.470
And it didn't really dawn
on me at the time, but,

00:13:14.470 --> 00:13:16.510
you know, that is what kind of gets...

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:18.070
What kind of happens.

00:13:18.070 --> 00:13:21.560
Because you get in such a
cycle, in such a routine,

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:22.740
and,

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.300
it's just,

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:25.480
every day is the same.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:28.960
It doesn't matter whether it's
Monday, Tuesday, Christmas,

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.890
it's all the same and,

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:33.020
it's just hard to break.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:36.440
